    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi naaragira Solomooni okwombeka Enju ya Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalemi ba Isirairi boona, abalemi b'enganda, abakuru b'ebihanda ebyaheerezaaga omukama, engabwa ez'alemaga abantu enkumi, ezaalemaga ebikumi, abalinzi abaalindaga ebintu by'omukama byona enkoroogi z'omukama na batabani be, hamu n'abalemi ab'ekikaali, abasaija ab'amaani n'abaserikale boona abamanyire omulimo, Daudi akabasorooleza Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byok 17:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yayemeriire yagamba ati: “Inywe bene baitu kandi abantu bange, muhunde amatu. Nkatunga ekiteekerezo kwombeka Enju ey'okuhumulizaamu Esanduuko ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA, kandi ey'okutamu akatebe ak'ebigere ebya Ruhanga waitu, nateekaniza ebyokwombekesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Ruhanga akangambira ati, ‘Torukwikirizibwa kwombekera ibara lyange Enju, habwokuba oli muserikale, kandi okaseesa esagama.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nabwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi, ninyowe yakomere yanyiha omunju ya isenyowe yoona mbe mukama wa Isirairi ebiro byona; habwokuba akakoma Yuda abe mwebembezi, yamukoma omunju ya Yuda eya ise nyowe, kandi omu baana ba ise nyowe, ninyowe yasiimire kufoora mukama ow'okulema Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omubaana bange boona (habwokuba MUKAMA akampa abaana baingi) mutabani wange Solomooni nuwe yakomere kwikarra ha kitebe ky'obukama bwa MUKAMA, aleme Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akangambira ati, ‘Mutabani waawe Solomooni, nuwe alyombeka Enju yange, kandi nuwe alyombeka ebikaali byange, habwokuba nkamukoma abe mwana wange na nyowe mbe ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu alyongera kukwatira kimu ebiragiro n'ebigambo byange nkooku arukukora hati, ebiro byona ndigumya obukama bwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nu bantu bange, nimbaragira omumaiso ga Ruhanga waitu, n'ag'ekitebe kinu ekya Isirairi yoona, nimbaragira kukwatira kimu n'omutima gwona byona MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ebi yaturagiire nukwo mwongere kwikara omunsi enu enungi, kandi mugirekere abantu ab'obusinge obuliija, ebe yabu ebiro byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe Solomooni mwana wange, omanyege Ruhanga owa sso, kandi omuheerezeege n'omutima gwona, n'omwoyo ogw'engonzi; habwokuba MUKAMA nuwe ayekebiija emitima yoona, kandi nuwe ayetegereza entegeka n'ebiteekerezo byona. Kakuba omuserra olimuzoora; baitu obu olimurugaho, alikumiisa hara, oku nuho oikale obusinge bwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oteho omutima habwokuba MUKAMA akakukoma kwombeka Enju niyo ebe kiikaro kye ekirukwera. Ogume kandi okole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nubwo yahaire Solomooni omutabani ekisisani ky'ekisasi ky'Enju ya Ruhanga, n'eky'amaju gaayo agandi, amaahurro gaayo, ebisiika byayo ebya kainaabiri n'ebya ha nsi, eky'ekisiika eky'okutamu ekitebe eky'okuganyirraho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamuha ekisisani eky'ebintu byona ebi akaba naateekereza ha bikaali by'enju ya MUKAMA, ebisiika byona ebiherraine, amaahurro ag'Enju ya Ruhanga, n'amaahurro ag'okwahuramu ebisembo ebihongerwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "entegeka ey'ebihanda ebya banyakatagara n'Abaleevi, n'omulimo gwona ogunyakukorwa omunju ya MUKAMA; ey'ebikwato byona eby'omulimo, ogunyakukorwa omunju ya MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obwingi obw'ezaabbu ey'ebikwato byona eby'ezaabbu ebya buli mulimo, obwingi obw'ebikwato eby'efeeza ebya buli mulimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obwingi obw'ebikondo eby'etaara n'etaara zabyo, ezaabbu eya buli kikondo eky'etaara n'etaara zakyo, efeeza ey'ekikondo ky'etaara n'etaara zakyo, ebikondo by'etaara nkooku byayekonyezibwaga ha mulimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obwingi bw'ezaabbu eya buli meeza ey'okutaho omugaati oguhongiirwe MUKAMA, n'efeeza ey'emeeza ez'efeeza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ezaabbu enungi mali ey'okukoramu ehuuma, ebbeseni, (n'ebikompe) ebbakuli ez'ezaabbu n'obwingi obwa buli kintu; n'ey'ebbakuli ez'efeeza n'obwingi obwa buli kintu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obwingi obw'ezaabbu enungi mali erukwetaagwa okukora itambiro ery'okucumiikirirraho obubbaani, yamuha n'ekisisani kye eki araarorraho kukora ebigaali eby'ezaabbu ebya bakerubbi, abanjurwire amapapa gaabo, baswekeriire Esanduuko, ey'Endagaano ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona, akabikora kurungi, naahondera ekihandiiko MUKAMA wenka eki yamukwasize ekyayolekaga omulimo gwona nkooku gusemeriire kukorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Daudi yagambira Solomooni mutabani we ati, “Ogume kandi otaterebuka, okole omulimo ogu. Otatiina, kandi oteekanga; habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga, kandi Ruhanga wange ali na iwe. Talikuleka kandi talikurugaho, omulimo gwona ogurukwetagwa kukorwa ha Nju ya MUKAMA gutakahoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebihanda bya banyakatagara n'Abaleevi ab'okukora omulimo gwona ogw'Enju ya MUKAMA mbibyo; omumulimo gwona; abanyoro nabo n'abantu boona, nibaija kukukonyera n'okukoraga kyona eki oraabaragiraga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
